 not count, so the task could run longer than the limit configured for it.\n\nSince #74869 the supervisor arms the duration on `TIRunContext.execution_timeout`, and every SDK uses that number. When the task is resuming (`next_method` is set), the run route now sends the time still left: the configured timeout minus the time since the original `start_date`, clamped at 0. A task that is not resuming still gets the full timeout. If no timeout is set, the field stays unset. A value of 0 means the limit has already elapsed, so the task fails as a timeout promptly. A `start_date` ahead of the clock does not extend the timeout.\n\nThe Python runner applies those seconds to its in-process timeout, which is what raises `AirflowTaskTimeout` and runs `on_kill`. It uses the task's own `execution_timeout` only when the server omits the field, and it no longer subtracts elapsed time itself. How long a trigger may run while the task is still deferred is unchanged.\n\nNo new execution API version. `execution_timeout` is already on `TIRunContext` from #74869 with the same type, and older clients still have the field stripped.\n\nTests in `airflow-core/tests/unit/api_fastapi/execution_api/versions/head/test_task_instances.py` use `time_machine`: a fresh run keeps the full timeout, a resume with time left gets the remainder, a clock ahead of `start_date` does not extend it, an already elapsed resume returns 0 with the field present, and a task with no timeout omits the field. Task SDK tests check that the runner uses the server seconds, falls back when the field is omitted, and raises `AirflowTaskTimeout` before the callable when the server sends 0.\n\nprek pre-commit checks pass, including airflow-core and task-sdk mypy, ruff, and the execution API version check.\n\ncloses: #73475\n\n---\n\n##### Was generative AI tooling used to co-author this PR?\n\n- [x] Yes (AI coding assistant)\n\nGenerated-by: AI coding assistant following [the guidelines](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/05_pull_requests.rst#gen-ai-assisted-contributions)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/75317/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/75317/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]]
